{"id":"steam-4817200","steam":4817200,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"Pet that Dog","summary":"Pet and collect 50+ breeds of dogs in our doggy dress up desktop companion! Every tap or click is a pet for your pup! If you pet your dog enough, they might dig up fun accessories you can use to dress them up!","about":"Pet that Dog is a desktop companion clicker game where every time you click or type you pet the dog on your screen! If you pet your dog enough, they may dig up a present with other dogs or accessories inside! Dress up your dog and watch them bounce around your screen while you work or play!\n\nCollect 50+ different breeds of dogs! Most of them also have alternative colors to collect!\n\nCollect 100+ different accessories to customize your dog with!\n\nPut as many accessories on your dog as you want and place them anywhere with layering included!\n\nCreate presets so you can swap between your favorite dogs and looks!\n\nSet a custom path for your dog to follow on screen to keep them moving but out of the way of your workspace!","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4817200/71e09d92419c6b475f0b6a7c6d74c7703c936fe5/library_capsule.jpg?t=1793920066","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4817200/23e1edcd4c6105830fe5cb1f84de74c1667a11f2/header.jpg?t=1793920066","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4817200/8d061c3bf62007660537c241e8d18b672aa7d9cb/library_hero.jpg?t=1793920066","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4817200/23e1edcd4c6105830fe5cb1f84de74c1667a11f2/header.jpg?t=1793920066","background":null,"screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4817200/cc840f19de7f06d5200ad501a18a5b1aa5b5c8c7/ss_cc840f19de7f06d5200ad501a18a5b1aa5b5c8c7.600x338.jpg?t=1793920066","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4817200/cc840f19